{"format":"guilde-carte","v":1,"id":"recopie-horloger","titre":"Le Sommeil de l’Horloger (recopie)","maj":1795898215878,"sorte":"salles","regles":"horloger","sablier":null,"recopie":"horloger","textes":{},"options":{"palier":{"y":5,"x0":3,"x1":20,"cx":15}},"etages":[{"id":"e0","nom":"Le sommet","w":24,"h":7},{"id":"e1","nom":"1er étage","w":24,"h":9},{"id":"e2","nom":"Rez-de-chaussée","w":24,"h":8},{"id":"e3","nom":"Sous-sol","w":24,"h":7}],"salles":[{"id":"S","ref":"horloger-S","nom":"La Galerie des statues","w":4,"h":3,"cases":{"2,4":"porte","3,4":"porte:moitie"},"decor":"","lumiere":"claire","son":"galerie","img":"decor/salle-galerie-v2.webp?v=2","lu":"« Quatre statues de bronze autour d’un petit autel. Sur le mur, une fresque : quatre silhouettes agenouillées face à une flamme. Et… elles sont reliées par des engrenages. Tourner l’une fait tourner sa voisine. »","etage":"e0","x":3,"y":0},{"id":"H","ref":"horloger-H","nom":"Le Cœur de l’Horloge","w":10,"h":3,"cases":{"5,4":"porte","6,4":"porte:moitie","10,3":"meuble:cheminee"},"decor":"","lumiere":"claire","son":"coeur","img":"decor/salle-coeur-v2.webp?v=2","lu":"« Le sommet. La Grande Horloge. Son axe attend trois rouages. Posez-les… et quelqu’un va se réveiller. »","etage":"e0","x":10,"y":0},{"id":"B","ref":"horloger-B","nom":"La Salle des rouages","w":5,"h":4,"cases":{"3,0":"porte","1,4":"meuble:tonneaux"},"decor":"","lumiere":"claire","son":"rouages","img":"decor/salle-rouages-v2.webp?v=2","lu":"« Quatre leviers. Baissez-les tous ensemble : ils ouvrent la grande porte de bronze, tout en haut, au sommet. »","etage":"e1","x":2,"y":2},{"id":"E","ref":"horloger-E","nom":"L’Atelier abandonné","w":3,"h":3,"cases":{"2,0":"porte","3,1":"meuble:etabli","3,3":"meuble:armoire"},"decor":"","lumiere":"claire","son":"atelier","img":"decor/salle-atelier-v2.webp?v=2","lu":"« Un vieil atelier. Des outils, des ressorts… et un établi qui n’a pas été rangé depuis cent ans. »","etage":"e1","x":9,"y":2},{"id":"F","ref":"horloger-F","nom":"La Bibliothèque des heures","w":4,"h":4,"cases":{"3,0":"porte","2,0":"porte:moitie","4,5":"meuble:etagere"},"decor":"","lumiere":"claire","son":"biblio","img":"decor/salle-bibliotheque-v2.webp?v=2","lu":"« Chut. C’est une bibliothèque. Le Livre des heures est tout en haut d’une étagère : il faut être deux pour l’attraper. »","etage":"e1","x":13,"y":2},{"id":"P","ref":"horloger-P","nom":"Le Cagibi grillagé","w":2,"h":3,"cases":{"1,3":"meuble:coffre"},"decor":"","lumiere":"claire","son":"cagibi","img":"decor/salle-cagibi-v2.webp?v=2","lu":"« Une grille de fer. Dans le couloir, une dalle qui s’enfonce quand on marche dessus… Quelqu’un doit rester dessus pour que les autres passent. »","etage":"e1","x":18,"y":2},{"id":"A","ref":"horloger-A","nom":"Le Hall d’entrée","w":5,"h":3,"cases":{"3,0":"porte","3,4":"porte","5,1":"meuble:coffre","1,3":"meuble:tonneaux"},"decor":"","lumiere":"claire","son":"hall","img":"decor/salle-hall-v2.webp?v=2","lu":"« Le hall. Tout est figé, même la poussière. Derrière nous, la grande porte ; devant, l’horloge qui ne bat plus. Le sablier tourne. »","etage":"e2","x":2,"y":2},{"id":"C","ref":"horloger-C","nom":"La Réserve","w":4,"h":3,"cases":{"3,0":"porte","2,0":"porte:moitie","1,1":"meuble:caisse","4,1":"meuble:tonneaux","4,3":"meuble:caisse"},"decor":"","lumiere":"claire","son":"reserve","img":"decor/salle-reserve-v2.webp?v=2","lu":"« Une réserve pleine de vieux meubles. Si j’étais un rouage, je me cacherais là. Ou pas. »","etage":"e2","x":9,"y":2},{"id":"G","ref":"horloger-G","nom":"La Crypte des horlogers","w":5,"h":3,"cases":{"3,0":"porte","2,2":"meuble:tombeau","4,2":"meuble:tombeau","5,1":"meuble:coffre"},"decor":"","lumiere":"sombre","son":"crypte","img":"decor/salle-crypte-v2.webp?v=2","lu":"« Le sous-sol. Ici dorment les anciens horlogers de la Guilde. Fouillez avec respect. Et vite. »","etage":"e3","x":10,"y":2}],"couloirs":[{"id":"K5","nom":"Le palier du sommet","etage":"e0","cases":["3,5","4,5","5,5","6,5","7,5","8,5","9,5